      "text": "                                        USER\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                               Query / Conversation\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                Intent Analyzer\n                                          │\n                   Is this a Product Details Request?\n                                          │\n                     ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐\n                     │                                         │\n                    No                                        Yes\n                     │                                         │\n                     ▼                                         ▼\n            Route to Other Workflow               Conversation Context Manager\n                                                          │\n                                                          ▼\n                                               Product Resolution Engine\n                                                          │\n          ┌───────────────────────┬───────────────────────┬────────────────────────┐\n          │                       │                       │                        │\n          ▼                       ▼                       ▼                        ▼\n     Exact Match          Ambiguous Match         Multiple Products          No Product Found\n          │                       │                       │                        │\n          │                       ▼                       ▼                        ▼\n          │              Ask User Clarification     Intent Decision         Reason Analysis\n          │                                               │                      │\n          │                                  ┌────────────┴──────────┐     ┌─────┴─────────┐\n          │                                  ▼                       ▼     ▼               ▼\n          │                          Product Details         Compare        Typo / Wrong    Recommendation\n          │                            Workflow             Workflow         Product Name      Request\n          │                                                           │          │               │\n          │                                                           │          ▼               ▼\n          │                                                           │   Suggest Similar   Recommendation\n          │                                                           │      Products         Workflow\n          │                                                           │\n          └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                 Tool Planner\n                          (What information is needed?)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                           Execution Plan Generator\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                        Information Source Selector\n                  (Map required information to business domains)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                               Retrieval Layer\n                                          │\n        ┌────────────────┬────────────────┬────────────────┬────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n        ▼                ▼                ▼                ▼                 ▼\n  Product Tool      Pricing Tool     Inventory Tool    Review Tool     Document Tool\n        │                │                │                │                 │\n        ▼                ▼                ▼                ▼                 ▼\n Product Repo      Pricing Repo    Inventory Repo    Review Repo    Semantic Retriever\n        │                │                │                │                 │\n        ▼                ▼                ▼                ▼                 ▼\n PostgreSQL       PostgreSQL       PostgreSQL       PostgreSQL         Qdrant\n                                                                    (Vector DB)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                Context Builder\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                Prompt Builder\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                           LLM Response Generator\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                             Response Validator\n                         (Grounding + Business Rules)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                             Response Formatter\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                         USER",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                                        USER\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                               Query / Conversation\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                Intent Analyzer\n                                          │\n                   Is this a Product Details Request?\n                                          │\n                     ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐\n                     │                                         │\n                    No                                        Yes\n                     │                                         │\n                     ▼                                         ▼\n            Route to Other Workflow               Conversation Context Manager\n                                                          │\n                                                          ▼\n                                               Product Resolution Engine\n                                                          │\n          ┌───────────────────────┬───────────────────────┬────────────────────────┐\n          │                       │                       │                        │\n          ▼                       ▼                       ▼                        ▼\n     Exact Match          Ambiguous Match         Multiple Products          No Product Found\n          │                       │                       │                        │\n          │                       ▼                       ▼                        ▼\n          │              Ask User Clarification     Intent Decision         Reason Analysis\n          │                                               │                      │\n          │                                  ┌────────────┴──────────┐     ┌─────┴─────────┐\n          │                                  ▼                       ▼     ▼               ▼\n          │                          Product Details         Compare        Typo / Wrong    Recommendation\n          │                            Workflow             Workflow         Product Name      Request\n          │                                                           │          │               │\n          │                                                           │          ▼               ▼\n          │                                                           │   Suggest Similar   Recommendation\n          │                                                           │      Products         Workflow\n          │                                                           │\n          └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                 Tool Planner\n                          (What information is needed?)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                           Execution Plan Generator\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                        Information Source Selector\n                  (Map required information to business domains)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                               Retrieval Layer\n                                          │\n        ┌────────────────┬────────────────┬────────────────┬────────────────┬─────────────────┐\n        ▼                ▼                ▼                ▼                 ▼\n  Product Tool      Pricing Tool     Inventory Tool    Review Tool     Document Tool\n        │                │                │                │                 │\n        ▼                ▼                ▼                ▼                 ▼\n Product Repo      Pricing Repo    Inventory Repo    Review Repo    Semantic Retriever\n        │                │                │                │                 │\n        ▼                ▼                ▼                ▼                 ▼\n PostgreSQL       PostgreSQL       PostgreSQL       PostgreSQL         Qdrant\n                                                                    (Vector DB)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                Context Builder\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                Prompt Builder\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                           LLM Response Generator\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                             Response Validator\n                         (Grounding + Business Rules)\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                             Response Formatter\n                                          │\n                                          ▼\n                                         USER",
